, ["questwords", 17036, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 17046, null, "dialog"]], "Very well. It appears Larvae are causing quite a headache for novice travelers to the Dungeon these days. If you defeat 40 Larvae, I will offer you a choice of two rewards from 30 Healing Potions, 30 Mana Potions, and 4 Small SD Potions. When you claim you rewards, make sure you have at least 20 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2024, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 15-49, Advanced character: Level 15-29)": [["questwords", 2025, null, "dialog"]], "Very well. I will take on this challenge.": [["questwords", 2027, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2033, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2063, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2069, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2083, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2089, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2101, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2107, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2119, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2125, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2137, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2143, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2155, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2161, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4027, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4033, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4069, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4089, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4107, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4125, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4143, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4161, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5027, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5057, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5071, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5083, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5095, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5107, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 1. Come back to me after defeating 1 Guardsman, and I will give you 100,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 2030, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 15-49, Advanced character: Level 15-29)": [["questwords", 2031, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 1. Come back to me after that, and I will give you 100,000 EXP points and 200,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 2036, null, "dialog"]], "Have you been to Chaos Castle? If not, it'll be an excellent opportunity to prove your strength. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (Basic character: Level 50-119, Advanced character: Level 30-99)": [["questwords", 2037, null, "dialog"]], "You will stand by for about a minute before actually entering. The event starts once this standby time passes. Once it does start, travelers are pitted against 50 corrupt guardsmen in a no-holds-barred melee to the death.": [["questwords", 2050, null, "dialog"]], "You are back sooner than I thought. I will give you a quest that will earn you the item you need to enter the event. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 50-119, Advanced character: Level 30-99)": [["questwords", 2055, null, "dialog"]], "Very well. It appears Hell Spiders are causing quite a headache for novice travelers to the Dungeon these days. If you defeat 60 Hell Spiders, I will offer you a choice of two rewards from 15 Large Healing Potions, 15 Large Mana Potions, and 8 Small SD Potions. When you claim your rewards, make sure you have at least 13 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2060, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 50-119, Advanced character: Level 30-99)": [["questwords", 2061, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 2. Come back to me after defeating 3 Guardsman, and I will give you 200,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 2066, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 50-119, Advanced character: Level 30-99)": [["questwords", 2067, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 2. Come back to me after that, and I will give you 400,000 EXP points and 300,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 2072, null, "dialog"]], "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Chaos Castle by now. The event will now be even more challenging because you will face more powerful users and corrupt guardsmen.": [["questwords", 2073, null, "dialog"]], "So it's the real deal from now on. I understand.": [["questwords", 2074, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4074, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5062, null, "dialog"]], "I will give you a quest that will earn you the item you need to enter the event. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 120-179, Advanced character: Level 100-159)": [["questwords", 2075, null, "dialog"]], "There's a rumor about Dark Knights and Gorgons from the lowest level of the Dungeon planning something sinister. Go to Dungeon Level 3 and defeat 80 Dark Knights. Do this, and I will give you a choice of two rewards from 30 Large Healing Potions, 30 Large Mana Potions, and 15 Small Complex Potions. When you claim your rewards, make sure you have at least 20 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2080, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 120-179, Advanced character: Level 100-159)": [["questwords", 2081, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 3. Come back to me after defeating 5 Guardsmen, and I will give you 800,000 EXP points and 500,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 2086, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 120-179, Advanced character: Level 100-159)": [["questwords", 2087, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 3. Come back to me after that, and I will give you 1,000,000 EXP points and 1 Jewel of Chaos as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 2092, null, "dialog"]], "It shouldn't be too difficult for you to train in Chaos Castle. I have a quest for you. One through which you can earn the items you'll need in Chaos Castle.... Will you accept? (Basic character: Level 180-239, Advanced character: Level 160-219)": [["questwords", 2093, null, "dialog"]], "Accept the quest.": [["questwords", 2095, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2113, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2131, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2149, null, "dialog"]], "Devils located on Levels 4 through 6 of the Lost Tower should suffice. Go to the Lost Tower and defeat 100 Devils. Come see me after that, and I will give you a choice between 15 SD Potions and 15 Complex Potions as your reward. When you claim your rewards, make sure you have at least 15 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2098, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 180-239, Advanced character: Level 160-219)": [["questwords", 2099, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 4. Come back to me after defeating 1 traveler wearing the Armor of Guardsman, and I will give you 300,000 Zens and 1 Jewel of Chaos as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 2104, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 180-239, Advanced character: Level 160-219)": [["questwords", 2105, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 4. I will give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 2110, null, "dialog"]], "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Chaos Castle by now. However, it should still be difficult for you to acquire the necessary item. I have a quest for you. One through which you can earn the items you'll need in Chaos Castle.... Will you accept? (Basic character: Level 240-299, Advanced character: Level 220-279)": [["questwords", 2111, null, "dialog"]], "Queen Rainiers in Icarus should suffice. Go to Icarus and defeat 100 Queen Rainiers. Come see me after that, and I will give you a choice between 10 Large SD Potions and 30 Complex Potions as your reward. When you claim you rewards, make sure you have at least 10 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2116, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 240-299, Advanced character: Level 220-279)": [["questwords", 2117, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 5. Come back to me after defeating 3 travelers wearing the Armor of Guardsman, and I will give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 2122, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 240-299, Advanced character: Level 220-279)": [["questwords", 2123, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 5. I will give you 1 Jewel of Bless as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 2128, null, "dialog"]], "You'd be mistaken to think you've reached the peak. Testing yourself and your abilities at Chaos Castle isn't a bad idea. I have a quest for you. One through which you can earn the items you'll need in Chaos Castle.... Will you accept? (Basic character: Level 300-400, Advanced character: Level 280-400)": [["questwords", 2129, null, "dialog"]], "Zaikans from Tarkan 2 should suffice. Go to Tarkan 2 and defeat 30 Zaikans. Come see me after that, and I will give you a choice between 20 Large SD Potions and 30 Large Complex Potions as your reward. When you claim your rewards, make sure you have at least 20 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2134, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 300-400, Advanced character: Level 280-400)": [["questwords", 2135, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 6. Come back to me after defeating 5 travelers wearing the Armor of Guardsman, and I will give you 1 Jewel of Harmony as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 2140, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (Basic character: Level 300-400, Advanced character: Level 280-400)": [["questwords", 2141, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 6. I will give you 1 Jewel of Life as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 2146, null, "dialog"]], "I'm sure you have a long trail of defeated monsters behind you. However, travelers widely vary in terms of their skills. If you're unsure of your own skills, proving yourself at Chaos Castle should give you some clarity. I have a quest for you. One through which you can earn the items you'll need in Chaos Castle.... Will you accept? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 2147, null, "dialog"]], "Shadow Pawns from the Swamp of Peace should suffice. Go to the Swamp of Peace and defeat 100 Shadow Pawns. Come see me after that, and I will give you a choice between 30 Large SD Potions and 45 Large Complex Potions as your reward. When you claim your reward, make sure you have at least 30 empty slots in your Inventory. Remember that.": [["questwords", 2152, null, "dialog"]], "Taking on the challenges of Chaos Castle is tantamount to testing one's own limitations. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 2153, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 7. Come back to me after defeating 10 travelers wearing the Armor of Guardsman, and I will give you 2 Jewels of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 2158, null, "dialog"]], "Surviving Chaos Castle is proof of how well you've trained. Will you go to Chaos Castle and see how far your training has taken you? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 2159, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 7. I will give you 2 Jewels of Bless as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 2164, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle is a place where you can test your own limitations. If you want to find out your limitations, go inquire with a Shadow Phantom Soldier about the castle.": [["questwords", 2801, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2810, null, "dialog"]], "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Chaos Castle challenge. If you survive Chaos Castle, you can claim a hefty reward.": [["questwords", 2802, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2811, null, "dialog"]], "The Shadow Phantom Soldier will give you an Armor of Guardsman, which you'll need to enter Chaos Castle. Receive the armor and take the Chaos Castle challenge.": [["questwords", 2803, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2812, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle will push you to your limits and shouldn't be taken lightly. Be sure to prepare yourself before going there. Go to the Shadow Phantom Soldier and accept a quest that will earn you the items you'll need at Chaos Castle.": [["questwords", 2804, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2813, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2819, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2825, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2831, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2837, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2843, null, "dialog"]], "Defeat 40 Larvae from Dungeon Level 1 and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a choice of two rewards from 30 Healing Potions, 30 Mana Potions, and 4 Small SD Potions.": [["questwords", 2805, null, "dialog"]], "It's time for you to test your limits at Chaos Castle. Go see the Shadow Phantom Soldier, test your limitations, and then take the Chaos Castle challenge.": [["questwords", 2806, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2815, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2821, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2827, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2833, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2839, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2845, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 1. Defeat 1 Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 2807, null, "dialog"]], "This time, the objective is to survive Chaos Castle. Go see the Shadow Phantom Soldier, take the extreme test, and then take on the Chaos Castle challenge.": [["questwords", 2808, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2817, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2823, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2829, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2835, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2841, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 2847, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 1 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 2809, null, "dialog"]], "Defeat 60 Hell Spiders from Dungeon Level 2 and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a choice of two rewards from 15 Large Healing Potions, 15 Large Mana Potions, and 8 Small SD Potions.": [["questwords", 2814, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 2. Defeat 3 Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 2816, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 2 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 2818, null, "dialog"]], "Defeat 80 Dark Knights from Dungeon Level 3 and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a choice of two rewards from 30 Large Healing Potions, 30 Large Mana Potions, and 15 Small Complex Potions.": [["questwords", 2820, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand on Chaos Castle Level 3. Defeat 5 Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 2822, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 3 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 2824, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Lost Tower Level 4-6 and defeat 100 Devils. Go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a choice between 15 SD Potions and 15 Complex Potions as your reward.": [["questwords", 2826, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 4. Defeat 1 traveler wearing the Armor of Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 2828, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 4 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 2830, null, "dialog"]], "Defeat 100 Queen Rainiers in Icarus and then go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a choice between 10 Large SD Potions and 30 Complex Potions as your reward.": [["questwords", 2832, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 5. Defeat 3 travelers wearing the Armor of Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 2834, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 5 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 2836, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan 2 and defeat 30 Zaikans. Go see the Shadow Phantom Soldier again to receive a choice between 20 Large SD Potions and 30 Large Complex Potions as your reward.": [["questwords", 2838, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 6. Defeat 5 travelers wearing the Armor of Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 2840, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 6 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 2842, null, "dialog"]], "Go to the Swamp of Peace and defeat 100 Shadow Pawns. Go see the Shadow Phantom Soldier again to receive a choice between 30 Large SD Potions and 45 Large Complex Potions as your reward.": [["questwords", 2844, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Chaos Castle Level 7. Defeat 10 travelers wearing the Armor of Guardsman and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 2846, null, "dialog"]], "Survive through Chaos Castle Level 7 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Chaos Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 2848, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Challenge (1)": [["questwords", 2901, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Challenge (2)": [["questwords", 2902, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Challenge (3)": [["questwords", 2903, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Challenge (4)": [["questwords", 2904, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Adaptation (1)": [["questwords", 2905, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Adaptation (2)": [["questwords", 2906, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Adaptation (3)": [["questwords", 2907, null, "dialog"]], "Chaos Castle Adaptation (4)": [["questwords", 2908, null, "dialog"]], "Proving One's Worth (1)": [["questwords", 2909, null, "dialog"]], "Proving One's Worth (2)": [["questwords", 2910, null, "dialog"]], "Proving One's Worth (3)": [["questwords", 2911, null, "dialog"]], "Proving One's Worth (4)": [["questwords", 2912, null, "dialog"]], "Proving One's Worth (5)": [["questwords", 2913, null, "dialog"]], "Have you ever heard of Blood Castle's barrier? Would you like to hear Archangel's request to help defend Blood Castle's barrier and join in the fight for the castle? (Basic character: Level 15-80, Advanced character: Level 10-60)": [["questwords", 3001, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle...": [["questwords", 3002, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3038, null, "dialog"]], "I know it well. I hear you need a special item to go there....": [["questwords", 3004, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3040, null, "dialog"]], "You're well-informed. In order to penetrate the barrier surrounding Blood Castle, you will need an Invisibility Cloak. If you pass a simple test of mine, I will provide you with an Invisibility Cloak before you head to Blood Castle. When you have time, come see me for an easy quest.": [["questwords", 3005, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3041, null, "dialog"]], "I will tell you then. Devildom's royal guards, who were summoned when Kundun succumbed to Secrarium, posed a great threat to the heaven world. To protect their base, the Twelve Saints formed a barrier around Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3006, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3042, null, "dialog"]], "Kundun, however, must've anticipated such a move. He hid beyond the range of the barrier and eliminated the Twelve Saints as soon as the barrier was formed. Luckily, Archangel evaded that peril and sacrificed himself for the barrier.": [["questwords", 3008, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3044, null, "dialog"]], "Kundun's Royal Guards, however, continue to attack the barrier, and are weakening it. We need Archangel's weapon in order to prevent this weakening of the barrier, and that's why we are now seeking the help of travelers.": [["questwords", 3010, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3046, null, "dialog"]], "I see. How do I enter?": [["questwords", 3011, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3047, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4011, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4047, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5011, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5041, null, "dialog"]], "It's very easy to enter Blood Castle. The battle event takes place every two hours from 12:30am and on. To enter, take an Invisibility Cloak that's right for your level to the Messenger of Archangel in Devias, five minutes before a Blood Castle event commences and ask to join. The Messenger of Archangel will then send you to the castle.": [["questwords", 3012, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3048, null, "dialog"]], "You will stand by for about a minute before actually entering. You'll enter Blood Castle after this standby time has elapsed. Once inside Blood Castle, you can buy some time by defeating 40 monsters summoned by a necromancer named Red Skull.": [["questwords", 3014, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3050, null, "dialog"]], "Go past the castle gate and defeat two Red Skulls who have hidden the Absolute Weapon. This will buy you some more time and reveal a casket containing the weapon. Destroy the casket, defeat more monsters, and return the Absolute Weapon to Archangel to successfully complete the Blood Castle quest.": [["questwords", 3016, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3052, null, "dialog"]], "I understand.": [["questwords", 3017, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3053, null, "dialog"]], "To find out when you can enter, simply press the F1 key. If you want to enter, take an Invisibility Cloak that's right for your level to the Messenger of Archangel before the scheduled start time. Come see me when you have time, and I will give you a quest that will earn you the Invisibility Cloak so that you can enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3018, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3054, null, "dialog"]], "You're back sooner than I thought. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 15-80, Advanced character: Level 10-60)": [["questwords", 3019, null, "dialog"]], "Very well. It appears Hell Hounds are causing quite a headache for novice travelers to the Dungeon these days. Hunt down 40 Hell Hounds, and I'll give you an Invisibility Cloak + 1 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3024, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 15-80, Advanced character: Level 10-60)": [["questwords", 3025, null, "dialog"]], "Of course. I gladly accept Archangel's quest.": [["questwords", 3027, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3033, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3063, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3069, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3083, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3089, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3101, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3107, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3119, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3125, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3137, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3143, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3155, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3161, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3173, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3179, null, "dialog"]], "I neither have the skills nor the warriors I need to take on this quest. Give me more time.": [["questwords", 3028, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3064, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3084, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3102, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3120, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3138, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3156, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3174, null, "dialog"]], "That's unfortunate. Come see me again when you find the right warriors to fight at your side. (The quest has been cancelled.)": [["questwords", 3029, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3065, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3085, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3103, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3121, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3139, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3157, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3175, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 1. Destroy the castle gate at least, and I'll give you 100,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 3030, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 15-80, Advanced character: Level 10-60)": [["questwords", 3031, null, "dialog"]], "The bond between my comrades and I isn't strong enough yet.": [["questwords", 3034, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3070, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3090, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3108, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3126, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3144, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3162, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3180, null, "dialog"]], "That's unfortunate. Come see me again when the bond between you and your comrades is stronger. (The quest has been cancelled.)": [["questwords", 3035, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3071, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3091, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3109, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3127, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3145, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3163, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3181, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 1 and complete Archangel's quest. Come back afterwards, and I'll give you 100,000 EXP points and 200,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 3036, null, "dialog"]], "Have you ever heard of Blood Castle's barrier? Would you like to hear Archangel's request to help defend Blood Castle's barrier and join the fight for the castle? (Basic character: Level 81-130, Advanced character: Level 61-110)": [["questwords", 3037, null, "dialog"]], "You are back sooner than I thought. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 81-130, Advanced character: Level 61-110)": [["questwords", 3055, null, "dialog"]], "Very well. It appears Gorgons are causing quite a headache for novice travelers to the Dungeon these days. Hunt down 60 Gorgons, and I'll give you an Invisibility Cloak + 2 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3060, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 81-130, Advanced character: Level 61-110)": [["questwords", 3061, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 2. Destroy the castle gate at least, and I'll give you 200,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 3066, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 81-130, Advanced character: Level 61-110)": [["questwords", 3067, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 2 and complete Archangel's quest. Come back afterwards, and I'll give you 400,000 EXP points and 300,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 3072, null, "dialog"]], "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Blood Castle by now. You should now focus on building the bond between you and your comrades to the point where you can rely on each another unconditionally.": [["questwords", 3073, null, "dialog"]], "The bond of fellowship.... Of course comrades should be trusted and valued.": [["questwords", 3074, null, "dialog"]], "I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 3075, null, "dialog"]], "Death Knights from the Lost Tower Levels 5 through 7 are causing great harm to travelers there. Go to the Lost Tower and defeat 80 Death Knights. Come see me when that's done to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 3 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3080, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 3081, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 3. Destroy the castle gate at least, and I'll give you 800,000 EXP points and 500,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 3086, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 3087, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 3 and complete Archangel's quest. Come back afterwards, and I'll give you 1,000,000 EXP points and 1 Jewel of Chaos as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 3092, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle is an excellent place to build your party's bond. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": [["questwords", 3093, null, "dialog"]], "Mega Crusts in Icarus are causing great harm to travelers. Go to Icarus and defeat 80 Mega Crusts. Come see me when that's done to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 4 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3098, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": [["questwords", 3099, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 4. Destroy the castle gate, and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Chaos and 500,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 3104, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": [["questwords", 3105, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 4 and complete Archangel's quest. I'll give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 3110, null, "dialog"]], "Is the bond of your Blood Castle party still strong? If not, I suggest you return to Blood Castle to strengthen it. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": [["questwords", 3111, null, "dialog"]], "Tantaloses from Tarkan Level 2 are causing great harm to travelers there. Go to Tarkan Level 2 and hunt down 100 Tantaloses. Come see me when that's done to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 5 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3116, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": [["questwords", 3117, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 5. Destroy the castle gate, and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 3122, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": [["questwords", 3123, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 5 and complete Archangel's quest. I'll give you 1 Jewel of Bless as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 3128, null, "dialog"]], "You might not find Blood Castle challenging anymore. However, it will still be hard for you to obtain an Invisibility Cloak that's right for your level. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": [["questwords", 3129, null, "dialog"]], "Phantom Knights in Icarus are causing great harm to travelers there. Go to Icarus and hunt down 100 Phantom Knights. Come see me when that's done to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 6 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3134, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": [["questwords", 3135, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 6. Destroy the castle gate at least, and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Harmony as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 3140, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": [["questwords", 3141, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 6 and complete Archangel's quest. I'll give you 1 Jewel of Life as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 3146, null, "dialog"]], "Having trustworthy comrades at your side makes all the difference when it comes to Blood Castle quests. However, it will still be hard for you to obtain an Invisibility Cloak that's right for your level. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 331-400, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": [["questwords", 3147, null, "dialog"]], "Twin Tails in Kanturu Relics are causing great harm to travelers. Go to Kanturu Relics and hunt down 100 Twin Tails. Come see me when that's done to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 7 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3152, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest. But more than anything else, solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (Basic character: Level 331-400, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": [["questwords", 3153, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 7. Destroy the castle gate at least, and I'll give you 2 Jewels of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 3158, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (Basic character: Level 331-400, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": [["questwords", 3159, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 7 and complete Archangel's quest. I'll give you 2 Jewels of Bless as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 3164, null, "dialog"]], "You've reached the final stage of Blood Castle, but it should still be enjoyable if you have your comrades at your side. However, it will still be hard for you to obtain an Invisibility Cloak that's right for your level. I have a quest that will earn you an item you'll need to enter Blood Castle. Will you accept? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 3165, null, "dialog"]], "Dreadfears in Kanturu Relics are causing great harm to travelers there. Go to Kanturu Relics and hunt down 100 Dreadfears. Come see me when that's done to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 8 as a reward. At your current level, it'll be too dangerous for you to hunt the monsters alone. It'll be better if you hunt in a party.": [["questwords", 3170, null, "dialog"]], "In Blood Castle, you'll be fighting against time. Good armor and weapons will, of course, help you complete your quest, but more than anything else solidarity of your party is what will count there. Will you accept Archangel's quest? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 3171, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 8. Destroy the castle gate at least, and I'll give you 2 Jewels of Bless as a reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 8.": [["questwords", 3176, null, "dialog"]], "It seems you have mighty warriors who are willing to fight at your side. Facing the challenges of Blood Castle together will certainly strengthen your bond with your comrades. Will you return to Blood Castle and carry out another quest of Archangel? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 3177, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 8 and complete Archangel's quest. I'll give you 2 Jewels of Life as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 8.": [["questwords", 3182, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle builds and tests the fellowship of you and your brothers in arms. If you wish to find out the strength of your party's bond, inquire with the Shadow Phantom Soldier about Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3801, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3810, null, "dialog"]], "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Blood Castle challenge. Successfully complete the Blood Castle quest to receive a valuable reward.": [["questwords", 3802, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3811, null, "dialog"]], "Visit the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a small reward.": [["questwords", 3803, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3812, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4803, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4812, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5803, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5810, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle builds and tests the fellowship of you and your brothers in arms. However, it's not an easy place to reach. Go to the Shadow Phantom Soldier and accept a quest that will earn you an Invisibility Cloak, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3804, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3813, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3819, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3825, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3831, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3837, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3843, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3849, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Dungeon Level 2. Defeat 40 Hell Hounds and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 1, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3805, null, "dialog"]], "When you first enter Blood Castle, you'll encounter an obstacle: the trust within your party. Go see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to test the trust within your party, and take the Blood Castle challenge.": [["questwords", 3806, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 1. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 3807, null, "dialog"]], "The objective now is to complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle. Take the Shadow Phantom Soldier's test and then the Blood Castle challenge.": [["questwords", 3808, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3817, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3823, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3829, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3835, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3841, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3847, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3853, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 1 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 1.": [["questwords", 3809, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Dungeon Level 3. Defeat 60 Gorgons and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 2, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3814, null, "dialog"]], "The gate that leads into Blood Castle is probably the greatest obstacle. Take the Shadow Phantom Soldier's test and then the Blood Castle challenge.": [["questwords", 3815, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3821, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3827, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3833, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3839, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3845, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 3851, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 2. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 3816, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 2 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 2.": [["questwords", 3818, null, "dialog"]], "Go to the Lost Tower. Defeat 80 Death Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 3, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3820, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 3. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 3822, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 3 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 3.": [["questwords", 3824, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Icarus. Defeat 80 Mega Crusts and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 4, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3826, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 4. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 3828, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 4 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 4.": [["questwords", 3830, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan 2. Defeat 100 Tantaloses and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 5, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3832, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 5. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 3834, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 5 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 5.": [["questwords", 3836, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Icarus. Defeat 100 Phantom Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 6, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3838, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 6. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 3840, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 6 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 6.": [["questwords", 3842, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Kanturu Relics. Defeat 100 Twin Tails and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 7, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3844, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 7. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 3846, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 7 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 7.": [["questwords", 3848, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Kanturu Relics. Defeat 100 Dreadfears and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive an Invisibility Cloak + 8, which you'll need to enter Blood Castle.": [["questwords", 3850, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Blood Castle Level 8. Destroy the castle gate and go back to see the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 8.": [["questwords", 3852, null, "dialog"]], "Complete Archangel's quest in Blood Castle Level 8 and then return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to claim your reward. However, this applies only to Blood Castle Level 8.": [["questwords", 3854, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Challenge (1)": [["questwords", 3901, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Challenge (2)": [["questwords", 3902, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Challenge (3)": [["questwords", 3903, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Challenge (4)": [["questwords", 3904, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Adaptation (1)": [["questwords", 3905, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Adaptation (2)": [["questwords", 3906, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Adaptation (3)": [["questwords", 3907, null, "dialog"]], "Blood Castle Adaptation (4)": [["questwords", 3908, null, "dialog"]], "Proof of Fellowship (1)": [["questwords", 3909, null, "dialog"]], "Proof of Fellowship (2)": [["questwords", 3910, null, "dialog"]], "Proof of Fellowship (3)": [["questwords", 3911, null, "dialog"]], "Proof of Fellowship (4)": [["questwords", 3912, null, "dialog"]], "Proof of Fellowship (5)": [["questwords", 3913, null, "dialog"]], "Proof of Fellowship (6)": [["questwords", 3914, null, "dialog"]], "Are you familiar with a hidden training ground known as Devil Square? It's an opportune place to develop your skills. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (Basic character: Level 15-130, Advanced character: Level 10-110)": [["questwords", 4001, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square...": [["questwords", 4002, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4038, null, "dialog"]], "I already knew that.": [["questwords", 4004, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4040, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5004, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5034, null, "dialog"]], "You're well-informed. I'll give you the item you'll need to enter Devil Square. When you have time, come see me for an easy quest.": [["questwords", 4005, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4041, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square is the place where the Elf Tree once stood. The Elf Tree was created by the mother of all Elves, an underground Elf known as Aria. This tree had the ability to produce Elves regularly. Then Secrarium tricked Lugard and appeared in Noria, at the location of the Elf Tree.": [["questwords", 4006, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4042, null, "dialog"]], "Having set his eyes on the tree's power of birth, Secrarium corrupted the Elf Tree and transformed it into an Immoral Tree that gave birth to monsters.  The monsters horde grew to astronomical proportions, and the kingdoms of the MU continent combined their forces to entrap the immoral tree in a space of nothingness.": [["questwords", 4008, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4044, null, "dialog"]], "Monsters, however, continued to spawn at regular intervals from the spot where the tree once stood. After careful consideration, the queen of the Elves decided to make a training arena of this place for travelers.": [["questwords", 4010, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4046, null, "dialog"]], "It's very easy to enter Devil Square. It can be entered every four hours from 3:00 a.m. and on (3:00 a.m., 7:00 a.m., 11:00 a.m., 3:00 p.m., 7:00 p.m., and 11:00 p.m.). To enter, take a Devil's Invitation that's right for your level to Charon in Noria five minutes before a scheduled entry time and ask to join. Charon will then send you to Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4012, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4048, null, "dialog"]], "You'll stand by for about a minute before actually entering. Once this standby time passes, monsters will start to appear. The monsters will continue to attack for ten minutes, and killing them will earn you points. If you score high enough, you might even receive a reward.": [["questwords", 4014, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4050, null, "dialog"]], "Is there anything I should know about Devil Square?": [["questwords", 4015, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4051, null, "dialog"]], "You'll face a steady stream of powerful monsters at Devil Square. Forming a party with other travelers before entering will give you a better chance of survival.": [["questwords", 4016, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4052, null, "dialog"]], "To find out when you can enter, press the F1 key. Then, take a Devil's Invitation that's right for your level to Charon in Noria five minutes before the entry time you've chosen. You'll be sent to Devil Square. Come see me when you have time, and I'll give you a quest that will earn you the item you need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4018, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4054, null, "dialog"]], "You are back sooner than I thought. I have a simple quest that will earn you an invitation granting you access to Devil Square. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 15-130, Advanced character: Level 10-110)": [["questwords", 4019, null, "dialog"]], "It seems Cursed Liches are tormenting the residents of Elveland with their dark spells and curses. Hunt down 40 of those Cursed Liches, and I'll give you a Devil's Invitation +1 as a reward. I suggest you work with others for faster results.": [["questwords", 4024, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. Would you like to train at Devil Square? (Basic character: Level 15-130, Advanced character: Level 10-110)": [["questwords", 4025, null, "dialog"]], "Fast growth...": [["questwords", 4026, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4062, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4082, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4100, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4118, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4136, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4154, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 1. If you achieve 50 points, I'll give you 100,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 1.": [["questwords", 4030, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will greatly help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to train at Devil Square? (Basic character: Level 15-130, Advanced character: Level 10-110)": [["questwords", 4031, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 1, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. Come back afterwards, and I'll give you 100,000 EXP points and 200,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 1.": [["questwords", 4036, null, "dialog"]], "Are you familiar with a hidden training ground known as Devil Square? It's an opportune place to develop your skills. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 4037, null, "dialog"]], "You are back sooner than I thought. I have a simple quest that will earn you an invitation granting you access to Devil Square. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 4055, null, "dialog"]], "They say Death Cows, driven by an evil energy, are up to something suspicious in the Lost Tower. Hunt down 60 Death Cows, and I'll give you a Devil's Invitation + 2 as a reward. It'd be wise to take on this quest together with others you can trust.": [["questwords", 4060, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. I have a little test that will tell me of your skills and experience. Would you like to take this test? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 4061, null, "dialog"]], "Yes. I'll take your test.": [["questwords", 4063, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4083, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4101, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4119, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4137, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4155, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. The test I have in mind is for you to enter Devil Square Level 2 and achieve 100 points. Do this, and I'll give you 200,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 2.": [["questwords", 4066, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will greatly help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to try and clear Devil Square? (Basic character: Level 131-180, Advanced character: Level 111-160)": [["questwords", 4067, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 2, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. Come back to me afterwards, and I'll give you 400,000 EXP points and 300,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 2.": [["questwords", 4072, null, "dialog"]], "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Devil Square by now. You'll now be moved to a place where even more powerful monsters spawn. There's no need to worry, however. You can expect rapid growth as long as you and your comrades execute coordinated attacks.": [["questwords", 4073, null, "dialog"]], "I have a simple quest that will earn you an invitation granting you access to Devil Square. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": [["questwords", 4075, null, "dialog"]], "They say the number of Alquamoses in Icarus is increasing and causing quite a headache for travelers. Go to Icarus and hunt down 80 Alquamoses. Come see me once that's done to receive a Devil's Invitation + 3 as a reward. They are strong foes, and you should hunt them with the help of others.": [["questwords", 4080, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. I have a little test that will tell me of your skills and experience. Would you like to take this test? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": [["questwords", 4081, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. The test I have in mind is for you to enter Devil Square Level 3 and achieve 130 points. Do this successfully and I'll give you 800,000 EXP points and 500,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 3.": [["questwords", 4086, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to try and clear Devil Square? (Basic character: Level 181-230, Advanced character: Level 161-210)": [["questwords", 4087, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 3, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. Come back to me afterwards, and I'll give you 1,000,000 EXP points and 1 Jewel of Chaos as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 3.": [["questwords", 4092, null, "dialog"]], "I trust you are quite used to Devil Square by now. However, obtaining an invitation to Devil Square remains a difficult task. Luckily, I have a quest that will earn you an invitation. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": [["questwords", 4093, null, "dialog"]], "Packs of Iron Wheels often attack travelers in Tarkan. Go to Tarkan and hunt down 100 Iron Wheels. Come see me afterwards to receive a Devil's Invitation + 4 as a reward. They are strong foes, and you should hunt them with the help of others.": [["questwords", 4098, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. I have a little test that will tell me of your skills and experience. Would you like to take this test? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": [["questwords", 4099, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. The test I have in mind is for you to enter Devil Square Level 4 and achieve 160 points. Do this successfully and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Chaos and 500,000 Zens as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 4.": [["questwords", 4104, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will greatly help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to try and clear Devil Square? (Basic character: Level 231-280, Advanced character: Level 211-260)": [["questwords", 4105, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 4, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. I'll give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 4.": [["questwords", 4110, null, "dialog"]], "You'll now have to focus more on coordinated attacks with your comrades than on simply defeating monsters. There is no better place than Devil Square to train for this. Complete a simple mission that will earn you an invitation to Devil Square, and train there at the side of your comrades. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": [["questwords", 4111, null, "dialog"]], "Beam Knights seem to be up to something in Tarkan. Go to Tarkan level 2 and hunt down 100 Beam Knights. Come see me once that's done to receive a Devil's Invitation + 5 as a reward. They are strong foes, and you should hunt them with the help of others.": [["questwords", 4116, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. I have a little test that will tell me of your skills and experience. Would you like to take this test? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": [["questwords", 4117, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. The test I have in mind is for you to enter Devil Square Level 5 and achieve 190 points. Do this successfully and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 5.": [["questwords", 4122, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will greatly help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to try and clear Devil Square? (Basic character: Level 281-330, Advanced character: Level 261-310)": [["questwords", 4123, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 5, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. I'll give you 1 Jewel of Bless as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 5.": [["questwords", 4128, null, "dialog"]], "The biggest obstacle to entering Devil Square, a training arena for fast growth, is probably obtaining an invitation. I have a simple quest that will earn you an invitation to Devil Square. Will you accept this quest? (Basic character: 330-400 Level, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": [["questwords", 4129, null, "dialog"]], "Ice Walkers are attacking and weakening the barrier that was formed to separate La Cleon and Devias from one another. Go to La Cleon and defeat 120 Ice Walkers. Come see me once that's done to receive a Devil's Invitation + 6 as a reward. They are strong foes, and you should hunt them with the help of others.": [["questwords", 4134, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. I have a little test that will tell me of your skills and experience. Would you like to take this test? (Basic character: 330-400 Level, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": [["questwords", 4135, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. The test I have in mind is for you to enter Devil Square Level 6 and achieve 210 points. Do this successfully and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Harmony as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 6.": [["questwords", 4140, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will greatly help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to try and clear Devil Square? (Basic character: 330-400 Level, Advanced character: Level 311-400)": [["questwords", 4141, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 6, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. I'll give you 1 Jewel of Life as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 6.": [["questwords", 4146, null, "dialog"]], "A moment of carelessness can spell disaster for even the most experienced warriors. I hope you'll remain committed to your training at all times. I'm charged with issuing invitations to Devil Square, an arena where you can undergo the most amount of training in the least amount of time. Would you like to hear more? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 4147, null, "dialog"]], "Of course...": [["questwords", 4148, null, "dialog"]], "Let's hear it.": [["questwords", 4149, null, "dialog"]], "Many travelers are disappearing from the Swamp of Peace because of Shadow Knights. Go to the Swamp of Peace and defeat 140 Shadow Knights. Come see me once that's done to receive a Devil's Invitation + 7 as a reward. They are strong foes, and you should hunt them with the help of others.": [["questwords", 4152, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square provides an opportunity to train yourself and build your experience. I have a little test that will tell me of your skills and experience. Would you like to take this test? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 4153, null, "dialog"]], "A wise decision. The test I have in mind is for you to enter Devil Square Level 7 and achieve 240 points. Do this successfully and I'll give you 2 Jewels of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 7.": [["questwords", 4158, null, "dialog"]], "The endless spawning of monsters in Devil Square will greatly help your training. Launch combined attacks with your fellow party members for even better results. Would you like to try and clear Devil Square? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 4159, null, "dialog"]], "Enter Devil Square Level 7, defeat the monsters that appear, and survive to the bitter end. I'll give you 2 Jewels of Bless as a reward when you return. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 7.": [["questwords", 4164, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square is a place where you can hone and develop your skills fast. If you want to get stronger quickly, inquire with the Shadow Phantom Soldier about Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4801, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4810, null, "dialog"]], "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Devil Square challenge. Training at Devil Square will earn you a valuable reward.": [["questwords", 4802, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4811, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square is a place where you can develop your abilities quickly. Prepare thoroughly before entering as this is not a place to be taken lightly. Go to the Shadow Phantom Soldier and accept the quest to earn a Devil's Invitation, which you'll need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4804, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4813, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4819, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4825, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4831, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4837, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4843, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Elveland 2. Defeat 40 Cursed Liches and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 1, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4805, null, "dialog"]], "The Shadow Phantom Soldier will give you a small reward if you manage fast growth at Devil Square. Accept the Shadow Phantom Soldier's test and take the Devil Square challenge.": [["questwords", 4806, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4808, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4815, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4817, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4821, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4823, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4827, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4829, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4833, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4835, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4839, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4841, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4845, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 4847, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 1. Defeat the monsters and score 50 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 1.": [["questwords", 4807, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 1. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 1.": [["questwords", 4809, null, "dialog"]], "Go to the Lost Tower Levels 2 and 3. Defeat 60 Death Cows and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 2, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4814, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 2. Defeat the monsters and score 100 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 2.": [["questwords", 4816, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 2. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 2.": [["questwords", 4818, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Icarus. Defeat 80 Alquamoses and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 3, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4820, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 3. Defeat the monsters and score 130 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 3.": [["questwords", 4822, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 3. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 3.": [["questwords", 4824, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan. Defeat 100 Iron Wheels and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 4, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4826, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 4. Defeat the monsters and score 160 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 4.": [["questwords", 4828, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 4. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 4.": [["questwords", 4830, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan 2. Defeat 100 Beam Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 5, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4832, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 5. Defeat the monsters and score 190 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 5.": [["questwords", 4834, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 5. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 5.": [["questwords", 4836, null, "dialog"]], "Go to La Cleon. Defeat 120 Ice Walkers and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 6, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4838, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 6. Defeat the monsters and score 210 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 6.": [["questwords", 4840, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 6. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 6.": [["questwords", 4842, null, "dialog"]], "Go to the Swamp of Peace. Defeat 140 Shadow Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Devil's Invitation + 7, which you will need to enter Devil Square.": [["questwords", 4844, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Devil Square Level 7. Defeat the monsters and score 240 points to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 7.": [["questwords", 4846, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Devil Square Level 7. Defeat the monsters that appear and survive to the bitter end to receive a reward from the Shadow Phantom Soldier. However, this applies only to Devil Square Level 7.": [["questwords", 4848, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Challenge (1)": [["questwords", 4901, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Challenge (2)": [["questwords", 4902, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Challenge (3)": [["questwords", 4903, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Challenge (4)": [["questwords", 4904, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Adaptation (1)": [["questwords", 4905, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Adaptation (2)": [["questwords", 4906, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Adaptation (3)": [["questwords", 4907, null, "dialog"]], "Devil Square Adaptation (4)": [["questwords", 4908, null, "dialog"]], "Fastest Way to Train (1)": [["questwords", 4909, null, "dialog"]], "Fastest Way to Train (2)": [["questwords", 4910, null, "dialog"]], "Fastest Way to Train (3)": [["questwords", 4911, null, "dialog"]], "Fastest Way to Train (4)": [["questwords", 4912, null, "dialog"]], "Fastest Way to Train (5)": [["questwords", 4913, null, "dialog"]], "Have you ever heard of Illusion Temple and the ancient relics hidden there? It's a place where travelers can find both wealth and fame. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (All characters: Level 220-270)": [["questwords", 5001, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple...": [["questwords", 5002, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5032, null, "dialog"]], "You're well-informed. I'm in charge of distributing items that are necessary to enter Illusion Temple. When you have time, come see me for an easy quest that will earn you a ticket in.": [["questwords", 5005, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5035, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Spells, the foundation of Illusion Sorcery, was discovered by an Archaeologist named Mirage. Mirage found the spells' power to be too dangerous and sealed it. His partner Lev, however, stole the spells to brainwash people and establish Illusion Sorcery. Illusion Sorcery gradually grew larger and brought chaos to the continent.": [["questwords", 5006, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5036, null, "dialog"]], "Grand Wizard Etramu vowed to destroy Illusion Sorcery and formed an army to subjugate its followers. Under Etramu's command, the alliance engaged the followers of Illusion Sorcery with formidable force. Despite having been driven all the way back to Illusion Temple, the followers continued to resist. As battle raged on, Lev disappeared and left the followers of Illusion Sorcery in confusion. Ultimately, they all met their death at the hands of the alliance on the temple grounds.": [["questwords", 5008, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5038, null, "dialog"]], "Due to Lev's illusion spells, however, the souls of the dead followers remained in this world to defend the temple. These souls believed Lev's return would allow them to reclaim their bodies and continued to safeguard the temple. Today, the temple is guarded by the alliance in case Lev does actually return and Illusion Sorcery uses ancient relics to lure in unsuspecting travelers to their cause.": [["questwords", 5010, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5040, null, "dialog"]], "It's very easy to enter Illusion Temple. It can be entered every four hours from 01:00 a.m. and on: 01:00 a.m., 05:00 a.m., 09:00 a.m., 01:00 p.m., 05:00 p.m., and 09:00 p.m. To enter, take a Scroll of Blood that's right for your level to Mirage in Elveland five minutes before an Illusion Temple event commences and ask to join. Mirage will then send you to the temple.": [["questwords", 5012, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5042, null, "dialog"]], "Upon entering, you'll need to wait for other players to enter. The players will then be divided into two teams: Alliance Camp and Illusion Sorcery Camp. The camp that brings over more relics to their own side wins.": [["questwords", 5014, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5044, null, "dialog"]], "Is there anything I should be aware of about Illusion Temple?": [["questwords", 5015, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5045, null, "dialog"]], "You'll not be able to use certain skills like Teleport or Telekinesis while holding on to a relic. On the other hand, there are special skills that can only be used in Illusion Temple. Using these skills to your advantage will make it easier for your camp to win.": [["questwords", 5016, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5046, null, "dialog"]], "To find out when you can enter, press the F1 key. Then, take a Scroll of Blood that's right for your level to Mirage in Elveland five minutes before the entry time you've chosen. You'll then be sent to Illusion Temple. Come see me when you have time, and I'll give you a quest that will earn you the item needed to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5018, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5048, null, "dialog"]], "You are back sooner than I thought. I have a simple quest that will earn you a Scroll of Blood, which will grant you access to Illusion Temple. Will you accept? (All characters: Level 220-270)": [["questwords", 5019, null, "dialog"]], "The increasing number of Bloody Wolves in Tarkan is becoming worrisome. Hunt down 50 Bloody Wolves, and I'll give you a Scroll of Blood + 1 as a reward.": [["questwords", 5024, null, "dialog"]], "You can find both wealth and fame at Illusion Temple. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 220-270)": [["questwords", 5025, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 1. Win and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 1.": [["questwords", 5030, null, "dialog"]], "Have you ever heard of Illusion Temple and the ancient relics hidden there? It's a place where travelers can find both wealth and fame. Why don't you listen to what I have to say and then decide? (All characters: Level 271-320)": [["questwords", 5031, null, "dialog"]], "You are back sooner than I thought. I have a simple quest that will earn you a Scroll of Blood, which will grant you access to Illusion Temple. Will you accept? (All characters: Level 271-320)": [["questwords", 5049, null, "dialog"]], "The increasing number of Iron Wheels in Tarkan is becoming worrisome. Hunt down 70 Iron Wheels, and I'll give you a Scroll of Blood + 2 as a reward.": [["questwords", 5054, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 271-320)": [["questwords", 5055, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 2. Win and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Bless as a reward. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 2.": [["questwords", 5060, null, "dialog"]], "I trust you are somewhat familiar with Illusion Temple by now. You'll now be moved to a place where even more powerful monsters spawn. There's no need to worry, however. You can expect rapid growth as long as you and your comrades learn to work together.": [["questwords", 5061, null, "dialog"]], "I have a simple quest that will earn you a Scroll of Blood, which will grant you access to Illusion Temple. Will you accept? (All characters: Level 321-350)": [["questwords", 5063, null, "dialog"]], "The number of Drakans in Icarus is increasing beyond control. Hunt down 90 Drakans, and I'll give you a Scroll of Blood + 3 as a reward.": [["questwords", 5068, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 321-350)": [["questwords", 5069, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 3. Win and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Life as a reward. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 3.": [["questwords", 5074, null, "dialog"]], "Were you able to acquire plenty of items for your training? I should tell you now that it's not so easy to enter Illusion Temple. I, however, have a quest that will earn you a ticket into Illusion Temple. Will you accept? (All characters: Level 351-380)": [["questwords", 5075, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5087, null, "dialog"]], "The number of Death Beam Knights in Tarkan 2 is increasing beyond control. Hunt down 30 Death Beam Knights, and I'll give you a Scroll of Blood + 4 as a reward.": [["questwords", 5080, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Level 351-380)": [["questwords", 5081, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5093, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 4. Win and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Chaos and 1 Jewel of Soul as a reward. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 4.": [["questwords", 5086, null, "dialog"]], "The number of Giant Drakans in Icarus is increasing beyond control. Hunt down 130 Giant Drakans, and I'll give you a Scroll of Blood + 5 as a reward.": [["questwords", 5092, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 5. Win and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Soul and 1 Jewel of Bless as a reward. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 5.": [["questwords", 5098, null, "dialog"]], "Were you able to acquire plenty of items for your training? I should tell you now that it's not so easy to enter Illusion Temple. I, however, have a quest that will earn you a ticket into Illusion Temple. Will you accept? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 5099, null, "dialog"]], "The number of Shadow Looks in the Swamp of Peace is increasing beyond control. Hunt down 150 Shadow Looks, and I'll give you a Scroll of Blood + 6 as a reward.": [["questwords", 5104, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple is a place where you can find both wealth and fame. If you take the temple challenge, you might acquire something essential for your training. Would you like to take the challenge? (All characters: Master Level)": [["questwords", 5105, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 6. Win and I'll give you 1 Jewel of Bless and 1 Jewel of Life as a reward. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 6.": [["questwords", 5110, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple is a place where you can acquire items and equipment for fast growth. If you wish to possess such items and equipment for yourself, inquire with the Shadow Phantom Soldier about Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5801, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5808, null, "dialog"]], "Hear what the Shadow Phantom Soldier has to say and take the Illusion Temple challenge. Win at Illusion Temple to claim a valuable reward.": [["questwords", 5802, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5809, null, "dialog"]], "You can acquire excellent equipment at Illusion Temple. Prepare thoroughly before entering as this is not a place to be taken lightly. Go to the Shadow Phantom Soldier and accept a quest that will earn you an item that will grant you access to Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5804, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5811, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5815, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5819, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5823, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5827, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan. Defeat 50 Bloody Wolves and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 1, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5805, null, "dialog"]], "The Shadow Phantom Soldier will give you a small reward if you win at Illusion Temple. Accept the Shadow Phantom Soldier's test and take the Illusion Temple challenge.": [["questwords", 5806, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5813, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5817, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5821, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5825, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 5829, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 1. Win and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive 1 Jewel of Soul. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 1.": [["questwords", 5807, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan. Defeat 70 Iron Wheels and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 2, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5812, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 2. Win and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive 1 Jewel of Bless. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 2.": [["questwords", 5814, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Icarus. Defeat 90 Drakans and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 3, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5816, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 3. Win and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive 1 Jewel of Bless. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 3.": [["questwords", 5818, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Tarkan 2. Defeat 30 Death Beam Knights and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 4, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5820, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 4. Win and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive 1 Jewel of Soul and 1 Jewel of Chaos. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 4.": [["questwords", 5822, null, "dialog"]], "Go to Icarus. Defeat 130 Giant Drakans and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 5, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5824, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 5. Win and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive 1 Jewel of Soul and 1 Jewel of Bless. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 5.": [["questwords", 5826, null, "dialog"]], "Go to the Swamp of Peace. Defeat 150 Shadow Looks and return to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive a Scroll of Blood + 6, which you will need to enter Illusion Temple.": [["questwords", 5828, null, "dialog"]], "Try your hand at Illusion Temple Level 6. Win and go back to the Shadow Phantom Soldier to receive 1 Jewel of Bless and 1 Jewel of Life. However, this applies only to Illusion Temple Level 6.": [["questwords", 5830, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple Challenge (1)": [["questwords", 5901, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple Challenge (2)": [["questwords", 5902, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple Challenge (3)": [["questwords", 5903, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple Adaptation (1)": [["questwords", 5904, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple Adaptation (2)": [["questwords", 5905, null, "dialog"]], "Illusion Temple Adaptation (3)": [["questwords", 5906, null, "dialog"]], "Strange Confrontation (1)": [["questwords", 5907, null, "dialog"]], "Strange Confrontation (2)": [["questwords", 5908, null, "dialog"]], "Strange Confrontation (3)": [["questwords", 5909, null, "dialog"]], "Strange Confrontation (4)": [["questwords", 5910, null, "dialog"]], "There are a number of ways you can prove your worth on the continent of MU. You can try to be the last one standing in Chaos Castle, or work with your comrades to battle through Blood Castle, Devil Square, or Illusion Temple. Travelers regard such feats as some of the worthiest accomplishments one can achieve.": [["questwords", 6001, null, "dialog"]], "So it's not just about equipment or level.": [["questwords", 6002, null, "dialog"]], "That's right. You do need good equipment and a high level to test your mettle against other travelers, yes. But just that isn't enough for you to become a hero of MU. I will help you receive recognition as a hero by giving you a series of missions. You may repeat these missions as often as desired.": [["questwords", 6003, null, "dialog"]], "Recognition as a hero...": [["questwords", 6004, null, "dialog"]], "To start off, I'll give you a simple mission to see if you have the right qualities to be a hero. Will you accept this mission? (Basic character: Level 240 - 270, Advanced character: Level 220 - 260)": [["questwords", 6005, null, "dialog"]], "Sure! What's this simple mission about? (Accept)": [["questwords", 6007, null, "dialog"]], "I don't need to be judged like this! (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6008, null, "dialog"]], "I'm sorry to hear that. There are many ways to become stronger, but they'll all take time. Remember that well.": [["questwords", 6009, null, "dialog"]], "You have accepted the first trial. I want you to prove your combat prowess by defeating 5 Guardsmen in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving till the end in Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Soul, or a Jewel of Chaos.": [["questwords", 6010, null, "dialog"]], "Congratulations. You have completed the first mission. Then I will give you the second mission right away. Will you accept this mission? (Basic character: Level 240 - 270, Advanced character: Level 220 - 260)": [["questwords", 6011, null, "dialog"]], "I accept the mission. (Accept)": [["questwords", 6013, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6019, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6025, null, "dialog"]], "No, I need some rest first. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6014, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6026, null, "dialog"]], "I'm sorry to hear that. You can't repeat the first mission if you abandon the second mission. You must complete the second mission before you can repeat the first mission. Please return if you change your mind.": [["questwords", 6015, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6027, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6039, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6051, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6063, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6075, null, "dialog"]], "Good decision. This mission requires you to raise your worth by claiming victory in Illusion Temple. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 800,000 Exp.": [["questwords", 6016, null, "dialog"]], "You have completed the first trial to become a hero. The next mission I'll give you is to see if you have the courage to be a hero. Will you accept this mission? (Basic character: Level 300 - 320, Advanced character: Level 271 - 320)": [["questwords", 6017, null, "dialog"]], "I think I have enough courage already. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6020, null, "dialog"]], "Courage is the most important trait for a hero. If you lack the proper courage, you can never be reborn as a hero.": [["questwords", 6021, null, "dialog"]], "Good decision. The first mission for the second trial involves defeating 10 Guardsmen in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Soul, a Jewel of Chaos, or a Jewel of Harmony.": [["questwords", 6022, null, "dialog"]], "Congratulations. You have completed the first mission. Then I will give you the second mission right away. Will you accept this mission? (Basic character: Level 300 - 320, Advanced character: Level 271 - 320)": [["questwords", 6023, null, "dialog"]], "Then I will give you the second mission right away. Show no fear against a number of foes at once, and attain victory in Illusion Temple. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 3,000,000 Exp.": [["questwords", 6028, null, "dialog"]], "You have now completed the second trial to become a hero. The next mission I'll give you is to see if you have the fighting spirit to be a hero. Will you accept this mission? (Level 331 - 350)": [["questwords", 6029, null, "dialog"]], "It's fighting spirit this time? I accept the mission. (Accept)": [["questwords", 6031, null, "dialog"]], "A fighting spirit doesn't benefit a hero. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6032, null, "dialog"]], "I hope you realize that a hero without a fighting spirit is merely a coward.": [["questwords", 6033, null, "dialog"]], "You've made a wise choice. The first mission for the third trial involves defeating 20 Guardsmen in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Life, a Jewel of Harmony, or two Jewels of Soul.": [["questwords", 6034, null, "dialog"]], "Congratulations. You have completed the first mission. Then I will give you the second mission right away. Will you accept this mission? (Level 331 - 350)": [["questwords", 6035, null, "dialog"]], "This one might be a little challenging, eh? I accept the mission. (Accept)": [["questwords", 6037, null, "dialog"]], "I am not ready yet. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6038, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6068, null, "dialog"]], "Then I will give you the second mission right away. Shock your rivals out of their senses by attaining a victory in Illusion Temple. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 5,000,000 Exp.": [["questwords", 6040, null, "dialog"]], "You have now completed the third trial to become a hero. The next mission I'll give you is to see if you have the right mentality to be a hero. Will you accept this mission? (Level 351 - 380)": [["questwords", 6041, null, "dialog"]], "I'll stay focused until the very end! (Accept)": [["questwords", 6043, null, "dialog"]], "I have no time right now. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6044, null, "dialog"]], "A hero without strong mind is little better than a corpse. Please continue challenging yourself until the end.": [["questwords", 6045, null, "dialog"]], "Good decision. The first mission of the fourth trial involves defeating 30 Guardsmen in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Life, a Jewel of Harmony, or two Jewels of Soul.": [["questwords", 6046, null, "dialog"]], "Congratulations. You have completed the first mission. Then I will give you the second mission right away. Will you accept this mission? (Level 351 - 380)": [["questwords", 6047, null, "dialog"]], "It's becoming more and more difficult. I accept the mission. (Accept)": [["questwords", 6049, null, "dialog"], ["questwords", 6061, null, "dialog"]], "I give up. Going any further is beyond me. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6050, null, "dialog"]], "Then I will give you the second mission right away. Protect the sacred item and don't give up before you are victorious in Illusion Temple. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 8,000,000 Exp.": [["questwords", 6052, null, "dialog"]], "You have now completed the fourth trial to become a hero. The next mission I'm about to give you is to see if you have the tenacity to be a hero. Will you accept this mission? (Level 381 - 400)": [["questwords", 6053, null, "dialog"]], "A hero is relentless. I accept. (Accept)": [["questwords", 6055, null, "dialog"]], "I don't have the time right now. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6056, null, "dialog"]], "Tenacity is another trait that a hero can't do without. Please remember that you can't get stronger if you aren't tenacious enough.": [["questwords", 6057, null, "dialog"]], "Good decision. The first mission of the fifth trial involves surviving in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, a Jewel of Life, a Jewel of Harmony, or two Jewels of Soul.": [["questwords", 6058, null, "dialog"]], "Congratulations. You have completed the first mission. Then I will give you the second mission right away. Will you accept this mission? (Level 381 - 400)": [["questwords", 6059, null, "dialog"]], "No more. Going any further is beyond me. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6062, null, "dialog"]], "Then I will give you the second mission right away. I know victory in Illusion Temple is difficult to achieve. Persevere again and again, and victory will be yours. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 8,000,000 Exp.": [["questwords", 6064, null, "dialog"]], "You have completed the fifth trial to become a hero. The next mission I'm about to give you is the last one to see if you are worthy of being a hero. (Master level)": [["questwords", 6065, null, "dialog"]], "The final hurdle, eh? I accept the mission. (Accept)": [["questwords", 6067, null, "dialog"]], "This door will not always be open to you.": [["questwords", 6069, null, "dialog"]], "Good decision. The first mission of the last trial involves surviving in Chaos Castle, delivering Archangel's weapon in Blood Castle, and surviving until the end of Devil Square. Complete this mission successfully and you may be reborn as hero. Your fame will echo across the whole continent of MU. You'll be rewarded with either a Jewel of Bless, two Jewels of Life, or two Jewels of Soul upon completion.": [["questwords", 6070, null, "dialog"]], "Congratulations. You have completed the first mission. Then I will give you the second mission right away. Will you accept this mission? (Master level)": [["questwords", 6071, null, "dialog"]], "I can almost see the end! (Accept)": [["questwords", 6073, null, "dialog"]], "I simply can't go on anymore. (Refuse)": [["questwords", 6074, null, "dialog"]], "Then I will give you the second mission right away. Attain victory in Illusion Temple. Complete the mission and you'll be rewarded with 5,000,000 Ex